 "notes": "The daily σερί (founder, 18 Nov 2026): days in a row with a match vote or the day's quiz finished, Athens days. fn dailyStreakSequence: steps play {day}, play_at {at: instant, the day is its Athens day}, play_days {from, count: consecutive days}, rollover {today: closes the days before it}, buy_freeze; a step with quiet: true leaves its events out. Events: played {day, current, milestone, newBest, freezeGranted, record}, same_day, frozen {day, freezeUsed, current, left}, broken {day, lostStreak, best}, bought, rejected. A freeze covers one missed day (free first), the number stays; one free freeze at day 3 and on every 7th day, only into a free slot (max 2). Milestones 3, 7, 10, 30, 50, 100. fn dayStreakMoment: the streakMoment rule on a played day. fn backfillDailyStreak: the starting σερί from real days (ending today or yesterday) and the longest run as the ΠΡ. SQL: core.day_streak_play, core.day_streak_rollover, core.day_streak_moment, core.day_streak_backfill (pgTAP 182).",
